;Recall last suspended transaction

Alias recall_trans 756 112
Alias search_button 412 439

Assert color 86 13 #000091 ;ensures someone is logged in
ClickButton Transact
Sleep 500

assert button recall_trans "Recall suspended transaction"
MouseClick recall_trans
;dialog box opens asking to enter 10 digit barcode, we dont have one
Sleep 200

assert button search_button "Search"
ClickButton "Suspended transactions" "Search"
;list opens showing all suspended transactions, just click ok because last one is highlighted already
Sleep 200

ClickButton "Select a transaction" "OK"
Sleep 1000

Load "Pay with cash"
